      "end_time": 51.0,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "But...",
      "start_time": 51.199999999999996,
      "end_time": 51.699999999999996,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "sitting next to you in the rain like this,",
      "start_time": 51.9,
      "end_time": 55.5,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "sometimes I do wonder...",
      "start_time": 55.699999999999996,
      "end_time": 57.3,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Never mind.",
      "start_time": 57.49999999999999,
      "end_time": 58.29999999999999,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Do you think the rain will stop?",
      "start_time": 58.49999999999999,
      "end_time": 61.29999999999999,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "I didn't bring an umbrella.",
      "start_time": 61.49999999999999,
      "end_time": 63.49999999999999,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "text": "Who knows?",
      "start_time": 63.699999999999996,
      "end_time": 64.5,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "text": "The thời tiết in Saigon is hard to predict.",
      "start_time": 64.69999999999999,
      "end_time": 68.29999999999998,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "text": "But if it doesn't clear up,",
