      "text": "stay here longer and keep talking.",
      "start_time": 74.99999999999999,
      "end_time": 77.39999999999999,
      "viet_words": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "text": "I like hearing you talk about chess and your thoughts on...",
      "start_time": 77.59999999999998,
